derivations.claim:
Exact algebra and remainders. The position identity is exact: $q_2=q+hM^{-1}p-h^2M^{-1}
abla V(q)/2$, so $ho_1=0$. In the momentum identity use step 3.1 with $w=hM^{-1}p-h^2M^{-1}
abla V(q)/2$. This gives $p_2=p-h
abla V(q)-h^2H_V(q)M^{-1}p/2+ho_2$, where $ho_2=h^3H_V(q)M^{-1}
abla V(q)/4-hR/2$. Its norm is at most $|h|^3(L_1M_1M_0+L_2M_1^2(P+M_0)^2)/4$, since $\|H_V\|\le L_1$ and $\|DH_V\|\le L_2$ are block restrictions of $DX_H,D^2X_H$.
